module jev_capability_discovery_followup

input capability_discovery_observation

status BOUND read-only selection question is available
status DEFERRED external execution or authorization boundary remains explicit
status UNKNOWN source, contract, query, or catalog boundary is unresolved

field status
field questions
field first_boundary
field is_read_only

constraint deterministic_questions
constraint preserve_first_boundary
constraint read_only
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_mutation
constraint no_permission_grant
